{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53431","headline":"颂 · 大义","name":"颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直下识玄旨，罗纹结角是。\n不识玄旨人，徒劳逐所示。\n䲺䲺鸟，守空池，鱼从脚下过，䲺䲺总不知。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"大义","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}